.claude/settings.local.json

# Build-loop working papers. The reviewer rewrites these fresh each round, and the
# durable record is docs/ledger-findings.md — triaged findings, not raw reviews.
# Kept on disk so the loop can read the previous round; never committed.
review.md
review.json

# Misc
*.sqlite3
*.mo
*.pot
docs/_build/
target/

# Brand assets — human-supplied originals (otter-*.png masters, resized/
# intermediates, icon candidates). Kept locally, NOT committed: only the
# downscaled derivatives the app imports (app/src/assets/otter-*.png) are
# tracked. See docs/milestones/M2.
#
# One deliberate exception: otter-icon-1024.png is the source `tauri icon`
# consumes to generate src-tauri/icons/, so it is a build input and has to
# survive a fresh clone. Git cannot re-include a file whose parent directory
# is excluded, hence the /assets/* + unignore-the-path-components form
# rather than a bare /assets/.
/assets/*
!/assets/brand/
/assets/brand/*
!/assets/brand/otter-icon-1024.png

# `tauri icon` emits Android and iOS sets unconditionally — there is no flag to
# restrict it to desktop (`-p/--png` disables the .icns/.ico set too). This app is
# desktop-only and packaging is out of scope, so those directories are pruned.
# Ignored rather than only documented in src-tauri/icons/README.md: a future
# `tauri icon` run silently recreates them, and prose does not stop `git add -A`.
src-tauri/icons/android/
src-tauri/icons/ios/
